### Message::Msg ###
	Index/Text   Random chat lines fake-online bots post (auto-Post feature).

### Config ###
	DelayRange   Lower = faster patrol loop around the map, in ms.

### FakeOnlineData::Info ###
	Account/Password/Name   Bot login credentials and display name.
	SkillID              Skill the bot uses to farm/PK.
	UseBuffs_0-2         Up to 3 buff skills the bot keeps up.
	GateNumber/MapX/MapY   Gate index to move map, and spawn X/Y.
	TrainRange           Attack range around its spawn point.
	MoveRange            How far the bot wanders from spawn (needs a
	                   high TimeReturn if allowed to roam far).
	TimeReturn           Minutes before returning to MapX/MapY.
	AutoPickupItem       Auto-pickup items (1=on).
	AutoReset            Auto /reset (1=on).
	PartyMode            0=off, 1=auto-accept party invites,
	                   2=auto-party nearby players, 3=only invite
	                   other fake-online bots.
	PVPMode              0=off, 1=retaliate when attacked,
	                   2=attack any player in range (auto-clears PK).
	PostOnDeath          Auto-post a message in chat on death (1=on).

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

